<title>USA: Dallas Cty, Texas, $20.985 mln First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Dallas Cty, Texas, $20.985 mln First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Co said it won $20.985 million of Dallas Cty, Texas, limited tax refunding bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.67 percent.</p>
</text>
